# Telegram is retired (the owner, 2026-09-14 and 2026-10-11): the code stays in
# place, disabled, and nothing scans it. The monitoring relay and its test are
# out of the seedgo audit, as they are out of pytest collection (pyproject.toml
# addopts) and the CodeQL scan (security.yml).
*telegram*
# The relay's single-instance lock. telegram_relay.py is its only reader, so
# with the relay out of the corpus the dead_code and unused_function standards
# convict an orphan. Its test (tests/test_instance_lock.py) still runs.
apps/handlers/monitoring/instance_lock.py
